<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia rate outlook very promising - Howard.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia rate outlook very promising - Howard.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Prime Minister John Howard said on Tuesday the outlook for Australian interest rates was very promising and he hoped rates could fall further.</p>
</text>
